# AB-025: Weak acid plus weak base gives a broad titration endpoint
# Design only: predictions below are not measured observations.
register lv3
add v1 water 100mL
add v1 CH3COOH 0.001mol
add v1 NH3 0.0008mol
measure v1 ph
add v1 NH3 0.0002mol
measure v1 ph
add v1 NH3 0.0002mol
measure v1 ph
new
add v2 water 100mL
add v2 HCl 0.001mol
add v2 NaOH 0.0008mol
measure v2 ph
add v2 NaOH 0.0002mol
measure v2 ph
add v2 NaOH 0.0002mol
measure v2 ph
inspect
